  "body": "[Current specification](https://console.spec.whatwg.org/#trace-data) for `console.trace` seems either incomplete or at odds with the current \"print a stack trace\" behaviour in most console implementations.\n\n![image](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/43438/12450466/de6c5efa-bfbe-11e5-8d7e-7158ca2e7a14.png)\n\nWhat, if any, are the plans on standardisation of `console.trace`?\n\nPossibly related to https://github.com/whatwg/javascript/issues/26\n",
